OL,3,GNEWSAMan, 85, in hospital after being
OL,4,Astruck by van
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn 85-year-old man is in hospital after
OL,7,Fbeing struck by a van in the Scottish
OL,8,FBorders.
OL,10,FThe accident happened at about 07:35 on
OL,11,FThursday on Market Place, close to the
OL,12,FHigh Street in Lauder.
OL,14,FPolice said a white Vauxhall Vivaro hit
OL,15,Fthe pedestrian and inquiries were
OL,16,Fcontinuing to establish the full
OL,17,Fcircumstances.
OL,19,FOfficers urged anyone who witnessed the
OL,20,Fincident or who has relevant dashcam
OL,21,Ffootage to get in touch.
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
